# scripts/opcount: `writerbench bench record N` writes a record N times
# on the prelude's Writer interface (W1), on a writer that does nothing:
# the interface encoder, which the IR builds, its dispatch and the
# writer's conversion at each write. The control is hand Go: a hand
# encoder on a Go interface whose writer does nothing.
unit write
sizes 20000 120000
args bench record {n}
control benchmarks/wirewriters/testdata/control
